<title>POLAND: Swarzedz gets debt restructuring deal.</title>
<headline>Swarzedz gets debt restructuring deal.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish furniture maker Swarzedzkie Fabryki Mebli SA signed a debt restructuring deal with creditors under which half of its almost 63 million zloty debt would be paid off with equity, Swarzedz president said.</p>
</text>
